{
  "id": "wf-explore",
  "displayName": "探索 · 多视角探索",
  "description": "复杂开放问题的多视角研究：统筹拆解 → 3-5 名专家独立研究（第一轮认知隔离、共享只读现场 + 独立 scratch）→ 综合分析（共识/分歧/证据地图，不多数投票）→ 结论评估（PASS / NEEDS_RESEARCH / INSUFFICIENT）。最多 2 次自动补充研究（总轮次 ≤3 含首次 BROAD）；第 3 轮仍 NEEDS_RESEARCH 保留原结论转人工决策；INSUFFICIENT 是合法完成类型。",
  "entry": "orchestrate",
  "control": {
    "maxRounds": 2
  },
  "workspace": {
    "template_id": "wf-explore"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "orchestrate",
      "profile": "orchestrator",
      "label": "探索统筹",
      "goal": "你是本轮探索的统筹。读取【任务输入】中的研究问题；若 run 产物目录已存在 `evaluation.md`（上一轮评估结论），必须先读取并只针对其中的 research_targets 与未解决缺口组织本轮补充研究。\n要求：\n1. 产出 3-5 名专家的独立研究任务书（expert_briefs）：视角互不重叠（如技术可行性 / 风险与反证 / 替代方案 / 成本与生态 / 用户需求等），每份含 expert_id（kebab-case 小写连字符）、focus（一句话视角）、brief（具体任务与取证要求）；\n2. 第一轮（尚无 `evaluation.md`）round_type=BROAD，做宽面覆盖；后续轮 round_type=TARGETED，专家任务只针对缺口，不重复已覆盖结论；\n3. 把研究方案写入 run 产物目录的 `research-plan.md`（轮次类型、研究问题、专家分工、预期产出）；\n4. 最终回复只输出本节点 schema 的 JSON（route=PLAN_READY）。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "PLAN_READY"
              ]
            },
            "round_type": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "BROAD",
                "TARGETED"
              ]
            },
            "research_question": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "expert_briefs": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "expert_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "focus": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "brief": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "expert_id",
                  "focus",
                  "brief"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false
              }
            },
            "plan_summary": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "round_type",
            "research_question",
            "expert_briefs",
            "plan_summary"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "research-plan.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "research",
      "profile": "researcher",
      "label": "专家研究",
      "kind": "fanout",
      "items": "$.results.orchestrate.expert_briefs",
      "goal": "你是被独立指派的一名研究专家。你的任务书（JSON）：{{item}}\n要求：\n1. 按任务书的 focus 与 brief 独立取证：区分事实 / 推断 / 未知，必须同时给出支持证据（evidence）与反证（counter_evidence），列出假设（assumptions）与不确定性（uncertainties），并给出置信度（confidence）；\n2. 只读方式使用共享 source 现场（运行上下文给出时）取证，禁止写入；工作笔记与中间产出只写入运行上下文注入的你的专属 scratch 目录；\n3. 禁止读取其他专家的 scratch 目录或研究报告，不得参考其他专家的结论（保持第一轮认知独立）；\n4. 正式研究报告写入 run 产物目录，文件名为 research-<你的 expert_id>.md（含证据、反证、假设、不确定性与置信度说明）；\n5. 最终回复只输出本节点 per-item schema 的 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "expert_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "findings": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "evidence": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "counter_evidence": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "assumptions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "uncertainties": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "confidence": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "high",
                "medium",
                "low"
              ]
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "expert_id",
            "findings",
            "evidence",
            "counter_evidence",
            "assumptions",
            "uncertainties",
            "confidence"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "synthesize",
      "profile": "synthesizer",
      "label": "综合分析",
      "goal": "读取 run 产物目录下的 `research-plan.md` 与全部专家研究报告（文件名形如 research-<expert_id>.md），做综合分析：\n1. 构建共识（consensus）、分歧（disagreements）与证据地图（evidence_map：每个关键结论标注支持与反证来自哪些专家）；\n2. 不做多数投票：分歧必须如实保留，并标注各方证据强度；\n3. 汇总仍未解决的缺口（open_gaps）；\n4. 写入 run 产物目录的 `synthesis.md`；\n5. 最终回复只输出本节点 schema 的 JSON（route=SYNTHESIS_READY）。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.route",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "route": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "SYNTHESIS_READY"
              ]
            },
            "consensus": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "disagreements": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "evidence_map": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "open_gaps": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "synthesis_summary": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "route",
            "consensus",
            "disagreements",
            "evidence_map",
            "open_gaps",
            "synthesis_summary"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "synthesis.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluate",
      "profile": "evaluator",
      "label": "结论评估",
      "goal": "对照研究问题与 `synthesis.md`（必要时回读专家研究报告）做结论评估：\n1. verdict 三选一：PASS（现有证据足以回答研究问题）/ NEEDS_RESEARCH（存在可通过定向补充研究闭合的具体缺口）/ INSUFFICIENT（证据本质上无法获得或已合理穷尽，如实收口——这是合法完成，不是失败）；\n2. verdict=NEEDS_RESEARCH 时必须给出 research_targets（具体、可指派的补充研究点数组）；verdict=PASS 时 completion_type=EVALUATION_PASSED；verdict=INSUFFICIENT 时 completion_type=INSUFFICIENT；NEEDS_RESEARCH 时不要填 completion_type；\n3. 始终填写 why / summary_for_human / current_state：概括各轮研究历史（BROAD / TARGETED 轮次与主要结论）与当前未解决缺口——若自动补充研究额度耗尽，这些字段将直接构成人工决策材料；\n4. 把评估结论写入 run 产物目录的 `evaluation.md`（verdict、理由、缺口、research_targets）；\n5. 最终回复只输出本节点 schema 的 JSON。",
      "output": {
        "outcomePath": "$.verdict",
        "completionPath": "$.completion_type",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "verdict": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "PASS",
                "NEEDS_RESEARCH",
                "INSUFFICIENT"
              ]
            },
            "completion_type": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "EVALUATION_PASSED",
                "INSUFFICIENT"
              ]
            },
            "confidence": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "high",
                "medium",
                "low"
              ]
            },
            "why": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "summary_for_human": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "current_state": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "research_targets": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "open_gaps": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "verdict",
            "why",
            "summary_for_human",
            "current_state"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "files": {
          "evaluation.md": "markdown"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "orchestrate",
      "to": "research",
      "outcome": "PLAN_READY"
    },
    {
      "from": "orchestrate",
      "to": "orchestrate",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "research",
      "to": "synthesize",
      "on": "success"
    },
    {
      "from": "research",
      "to": "$end",
      "on": "failure"
    },
    {
      "from": "synthesize",
      "to": "evaluate",
      "outcome": "SYNTHESIS_READY"
    },
    {
      "from": "synthesize",
      "to": "synthesize",
      "on": "technical"
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "$end",
      "outcome": "INSUFFICIENT"
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "orchestrate",
      "outcome": "NEEDS_RESEARCH",
      "countRound": true
    },
    {
      "from": "evaluate",
      "to": "evaluate",
      "on": "technical"
    }
  ],
  "bindings": {
    "models": {
      "orchestrate": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "research": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "synthesize": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-flash"
      },
      "evaluate": {
        "provider": "deepseek-official",
        "model": "deepseek-v4-flash"
      }
    }
  }
}
